<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    The Breach Jump's landing damage: a clone of Core's Bomb (Damages_Misc.xml) with the
    building factors made the point of the set. DamageWorker.Apply multiplies building damage
    by buildingDamageFactor, then the passable or impassable factor (Bomb 1 / 2 / 4, and Core's
    Wall adds its own x2 for Bomb, so a grenade's 50 does 400 to a wall cell, 100 to a door).

    defaultDamage 20 with x30 / 0.25 / 1 gives 600 to a wall cell (steel 300, hull 420, granite
    510; plasteel 840 and uranium 750 need the shoulders) and 150 to passable buildings, Bomb's
    4:1 ratio: a landing takes a door or light turret but leaves an 800 HP grav engine or a
    500 HP thruster standing. DamageWorker_Breach scales building damage by the instigator's
    SCWC_BreachPower first, so the shoulders' bonus never reaches pawns. The mod settings
    rewrite the impassable and passable factors from their wall and structure damage rows
    (Source/1.6/Settings/BreachTuning.cs); buildingDamageFactor stays as set here.

    minDamageToFragment 15 is Bomb's: without it the hit lands as one wound on one random part,
    and 20 to a heart or brain kills outright; with it the hit splits into 2 to 4 wounds of 5
    to 10. defaultArmorPenetration 0.15 mirrors the value the ability passes (GenExplosion
    ignores this field when handed a damage amount). Blunt rather than Bomb's Sharp: an impact,
    and end-game blunt ratings run lower. No heat energy (kinetic, not incendiary).
    explosionCenterEffecter SCWC_BreachLanding adds the shockwave ring; DamageWorker fires it
    on every breach explosion, planet or space, with no C#.
  -->
  <DamageDef>
    <defName>SCWC_Breach</defName>
    <label>breach</label>
    <workerClass>ShipcrackerWarcasket.DamageWorker_Breach</workerClass>
    <externalViolence>true</externalViolence>
    <isExplosive>true</isExplosive>
    <deathMessage>{0} has been crushed by a breaching impact.</deathMessage>
    <hediff>Crush</hediff>
    <hediffSkin>Bruise</hediffSkin>
    <hediffSolid>Crack</hediffSolid>
    <harmAllLayersUntilOutside>true</harmAllLayersUntilOutside>
    <impactSoundType>Blunt</impactSoundType>
    <armorCategory>Blunt</armorCategory>
    <minDamageToFragment>15</minDamageToFragment>
    <defaultDamage>20</defaultDamage>
    <defaultStoppingPower>0.5</defaultStoppingPower>
    <defaultArmorPenetration>0.15</defaultArmorPenetration>
    <buildingDamageFactor>30</buildingDamageFactor>
    <buildingDamageFactorPassable>0.25</buildingDamageFactorPassable>
    <buildingDamageFactorImpassable>1</buildingDamageFactorImpassable>
    <plantDamageFactor>4</plantDamageFactor>
    <corpseDamageFactor>0.5</corpseDamageFactor>
    <explosionAffectOutsidePartsOnly>false</explosionAffectOutsidePartsOnly>
    <explosionCellFleck>BlastDry</explosionCellFleck>
    <explosionCenterEffecter>SCWC_BreachLanding</explosionCenterEffecter>
    <explosionColorCenter>(0.85, 0.85, 0.95)</explosionColorCenter>
    <explosionColorEdge>(0.55, 0.55, 0.65)</explosionColorEdge>
    <soundExplosion>Explosion_Bomb</soundExplosion>
    <combatLogRules>Damage_Bomb</combatLogRules>
  </DamageDef>
</Defs>
